    {
      "content": "Awesome. Well either way while I have you on here, I kinda wanna quickly go over how the pricing goes so you know it would make a little bit more sense. Basically the main thing is we just really charge you know by the hour. So, our hour rate basically is, let me see so it is a Tuesday.",
