      "time": "2026-08-19T14:19:50.520458",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "4886812291923968"
    },
    {
      "content": "Our hour, the rate is $102 per hour per mover. Typically for homes this size, we sent four guys to be able to move everything. Anyone go and if it's a full packing service we usually send also send four guy, four movers to pack everything up. But the thing is for the packing that is kind of like more kind of customizable in a way like for example, you only need help packing with the kitchen or you know like the closet just like certain parts of the house you need help packing with. We can certainly adjust that accordingly. Once we do the walkthrough. But at the end of the day it is just by the hour, the only thing really that's not included in the hour. The rate is the cost for the packing with the, like all the boxes, bubble wrap packing paper but you'll only pay for the actual materials that was used for the move.",
      "name": "Jules Nicolas",
